# Route: guide 46 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to 59, 59
# quests, 3.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stormwind City, Thousand Needles, Duskwood, Stonetalon Mountains,
# Ashenvale, Felwood, Western Plaguelands): near Stormwind City -> Stormwind
# -> near Stormwind City -> Stormwind -> near Stormwind -> Stormwind City ->
# near Stormwind City -> Stormwind City -> Stormwind -> Stormwind City -> near
# Stormwind City -> near Stormwind -> The Shimmering Flats -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Oh Brother... (167; Foreman
# Thistlenettle 20); Collecting Memories (168; Skeletal Miner 17-18, Undead
# Excavator 17-18, Undead Dynamiter 17-18).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Quell The Uprising (387), Quell the Uprising (387), The
# Color of Blood (388), The Color of Blood (388), The Stockade Riots (391),
# The Stockade Riots (391), Underground Assault (2040), Underground Assault
# (2040), Bring the Light (3636), A Green Sample (92456), A Green Sample
# (92456), Power Overwhelming (92489), Power Overwhelming (92489), The Crone
# of the Kraul (1101), Gahz'rilla (2770), Crime and Punishment (377), Crime
# and Punishment (377), Vyletongue Corruption (7041), Corruption of Earth and
# Seed (7065), Blackfathom Villainy (1200), Barov Family Fortune (5343),
# Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384),
# The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of
# Love and Family (5848).

